  "details": "Id love to see a way to control video players from the menu its really frustrating when walking in a world and its super loud or its very soft some of the players have a small sound control that can be hard to hit and get the sound right and even maxing out the sound in world volume may not fix this, another reason to have a video player control in menu it would give better control for the world host pretty much our current version for the video player is like a 1970s tv where you have to get up keep changing the dials to get the right station.\nanother reason video players can cause lagg it be nice if I can ensure that when I go into a world that its turn off with a video player off option in menu.\na feature could be too that maybe a personal player can pop up similar to the personal mirror that follows you around.\nor maybe even a personal player that you can only see where worlds don't have one.\nI just believe the video players could use more control and some what out dated. \nwell this is my thoughts on the topic thank you for reading.",
